invariant: INV-46
file: src/mlkem_vector.c
catches: mlkem_vector_equiv_test
reason: mlk_vector_reduce stops eight coefficients short, so the last
  eight coefficients of each reduced polynomial keep their unreduced
  values and the compression after it reads values outside its range.
  bin/mlkem_vector_equiv_test runs every int16 value through both
  reductions and compares the coefficients.

--- old
    for (size_t at = 0; at < MLKEM_N; at += 8) {
        lanes_store(p->coeffs + at, lanes_barrett_reduce(
--- new
    for (size_t at = 0; at < MLKEM_N - 8; at += 8) {
        lanes_store(p->coeffs + at, lanes_barrett_reduce(
